From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 23:25:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Story Generator Tool returning an empty string

gpt-oss-20b is a reasoning model; with max_tokens=400 nearly all tokens
went to hidden reasoning, so Groq returned finish_reason=length with
content="". The empty passage was cached as a success and the Agent
invented its own answer.

- Raise max_tokens to 1500 and set reasoning_effort=low in call_groq
- Treat an empty/whitespace passage as a failure (fallback message,
  short-TTL failure cache) instead of returning/caching an empty string
- Add tests/test_empty_response_handling.py (no Postgres required)
- Update README, CHANGELOG, DEVELOPER-DIARY and IMPLEMENTATION-GUIDE
